    "2 倍高清（960×544），平滑纹理与锯齿。高负载时减少抗锯齿以优先保持流畅。重新启动游戏后生效。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2× HD (960×544) with smoother textures and edges. Anti-aliasing is reduced under heavy load to prioritize performance. Restart the game to apply."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2 倍高清（960×544），平滑纹理与锯齿。高负载时减少抗锯齿以优先保持流畅。重新启动游戏后生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2 倍高清（960×544），平滑紋理與鋸齒。高負載時減少抗鋸齒以優先保持流暢。重新啓動遊戲後生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
