    "支持 DS、3DS、N64 与 PSP 游戏；ZIP、7Z、RAR、TAR 自动展开。PSP 游戏存档自动保存；CIA/CIAx/ZCIA 安装后启动，更新和 DLC 需要对应本体。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supports DS, 3DS, N64, and PSP games. ZIP, 7Z, RAR, and TAR archives are extracted automatically. PSP games save progress through their own save system. Install CIA/CIAx/ZCIA packages before launching; updates and DLC require the matching base game."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "支持 DS、3DS、N64 与 PSP 游戏；ZIP、7Z、RAR、TAR 自动展开。PSP 游戏存档自动保存；CIA/CIAx/ZCIA 安装后启动，更新和 DLC 需要对应本体。"
